              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokiripi nywomo citho, kosa dhako m'opokere gi cwore, kwanyowoko nyako mambula wok i ot pa Isiraili, kosa citho m'oyido obedo cipa jacway ri Were i wi migam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.22",
